; A seed for the differential fuzzer: one commodity held at costs in two
; currencies, a reduction naming neither, and a cost currency taken from
; the group.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:Usd
2020-01-01 open Assets:Eur

2020-01-02 * "two cost currencies"
  Assets:A  2 HOOL {100 USD}
  Assets:A  2 HOOL {90 EUR}
  Assets:Usd  -200 USD
  Assets:Eur  -180 EUR

2020-01-03 * "reduce in USD"
  Assets:A  -1 HOOL {}
  Assets:Usd  100 USD

2020-01-04 * "cost currency from the group"
  Assets:A  -1 HOOL {90}
  Assets:Eur  90 EUR
